r their primary preference to resolve household friction."],"kapitel":[{"titel":"Introduction and Childhood Love Story","start":89.32},{"titel":"Family Mission and Stereotypes","start":651.84},{"titel":"Marriage Dynamics and Communication","start":1043.22},{"titel":"Home Management and Daily Rhythms","start":1667.84},{"titel":"The Laundry System and Simplifying Toys","start":2664.1},{"titel":"Hosting, Cooking, and the Voetberg Music Academy","start":3131.1}],"clips":[{"hook":"Writing down a childhood crush in a journal","start":256.47,"ende":285.989,"laenge":29.52,"byte_start":4103940,"byte_ende":4576233,"bytes":472294,"range_header":"bytes=4103940-4576233","vorlauf_s":0.0784,"inhalt_start":256.549,"anker_sha256":"efbf235511ae15b450b6e0e5d4728e39470fe7d9f8ace81ca37caeafac05b6dc","anker_ende_sha256":"5e93356d7f8042131e2406425beada5aff3fca063c9d1da2804fa10ecb855cce","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"After spotting her future husband under a trampoline at a family camp at age eight, she documented her intention to marry him in her personal journal."},{"hook":"Living six years without a smartphone","start":1089.28,"ende":1111.719,"laenge":22.44,"byte_start":17428897,"byte_ende":17787922,"bytes":359026,"range_header":"bytes=17428897-17787922","vorlauf_s":0.0784,"inhalt_start":1089.358,"anker_sha256":"83c6128f7a097de9e3de7531f6770c2abaa6dd8cebc2e37efeea71c8cd683a81","anker_ende_sha256":"33b6a0bc087cae5d9f98b833ecc235dbdc8fdd2da8dd54703a2d90db5ddc9e41","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"Opting out of modern technology, the household replaced smartphones with basic prepaid devices to maintain presence."},{"hook":"The real root of household clutter","start":2730.188,"ende":2753.698,"laenge":23.51,"byte_start":43683421,"byte_ende":44059583,"bytes":376163,"range_header":"bytes=43683421-44059583","vorlauf_s":0.0783,"inhalt_start":2730.266,"anker_sha256":"9fde49c89f09a37f9a3cb01ec47255e4de35a97a1f54bf21585000827c8bf61b","anker_ende_sha256":"8ebb8dae12aa44ed69bf7f3b7540fe9fe8a863aae646e79aff8b776b1fa7e4b8","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"Accumulating excess belongings stems primarily from an uncontrolled habit of acquiring items rather than a failure to clean them out."},{"hook":"Living in a canvas tent with six children","start":2982.896,"ende":3004.082,"laenge":21.19,"byte_start":47726758,"byte_ende":48065722,"bytes":338965,"range_header":"bytes=47726758-48065722","vorlauf_s":0.0784,"inhalt_start":2982.975,"anker_sha256":"e59dd03ef37a60931b2c4ecdb8722cdfe54c20693860204b2352f1261cefd01b","anker_ende_sha256":"0af7dfacc20300dccf7805265450d331cad7332b96d26e09baedcaf69f214d29","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"While constructing their permanent residence, the entire family spent half a year residing off-grid inside a tent structure."},{"hook":"A French-inspired laundry system without folding","start":3790.916,"ende":3819.024,"laenge":28.11,"byte_start":60655071,"byte_ende":61104794,"bytes":449724,"range_header":"bytes=60655071-61104794","vorlauf_s":0.0784,"inhalt_start":3790.994,"anker_sha256":"c50d1bb4acfe292593996549b258df019e734ce6145f57a48cbc81c18bc0a862","anker_ende_sha256":"85a2e1fe7dacfdc47cb4e73e85db1a067ecad3ed3f10887f06310050efa33d0f","einblendung_ms":60,"text":"By avoiding clothing inventory and utilizing individual wicker baskets in the utility room, folding clothes is eliminated entirely."}],"erzeugt":{"am":"2026-11-26T05:32:03+00:00","transkript_modell":"faster-whisper large-v3","transkript_quelle":"whisper","verstehen_modell":"gemini-flash-lite-latest","prompt_version":5},"sprache":"en","texte_sprache":"en","texte_herkunft":"erzeugt","dauer":4605,"veroeffentlicht":"2026-09-04T01:00:00+00:00","beschreibung":"Wife School continues — and today's professor is about to become my sister-in-law. 👯‍♀️\n\nKatie Voetberg married a Voetberg son before I did, so she's graciously agreed to give me a little training before I officially join the family. She and her husband, Elisha, live in a barn in North Idaho with their six children, host the Now That We're a Fami